feat: add real-time research streaming

- Created in-memory EventService (`apps/server/src/engine/events.ts`) for SSE broadcasting.
- Updated Auth middleware to support JWT tokens via `?token=` query parameter for native EventSource compatibility.
- Added `recordEvent` to `engine/db.ts` to persist `research_events` and emit them to connected SSE clients.
- Intercepted lifecycle methods in `db.ts` to emit real state-driven events (planning, searching, extracting, gaps, contradictions, etc).
- Implemented `GET /api/v1/research/:id/events` to backfill history and attach the client to the stream.
- Implemented `POST /api/v1/research/:id/cancel` to cancel active sessions.
- Redesigned `ResearchWorkspacePage.tsx` to consume SSE natively, maintain an event log, update task states iteratively, compute live statistics (sources, claims, gaps, contradictions), and handle resilient reconnection logic.
- Implemented and passed mocked backend event service tests.
